    {
      "t": "First PM hire. Own discovery and Agile delivery of a KYC/AML compliance platform (risk scoring, compliance review, AML screening) for a regulated investment firm; the first module shipped on schedule.",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Partnered with the client's Compliance Officer on risk-scoring bands and auto-approval thresholds over verified digital-ID data, replacing case-by-case review: 68% of applications auto-cleared and turnaround fell from 72 hours to under 8. Read the case",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Traced where KYC reviews stalled through 12 requirement sessions with 4 client compliance stakeholders, then redesigned the review and approval workflow, lifting first-pass compliance clearance from 23% to 61%. Read the case",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Cut question-change turnaround from 5 days to same day by replacing an email approval trail with a compliance dashboard: two-level sign-off for KYC and Enhanced Due Diligence (EDD) questions, plus EDD assignment to flagged users. Read the case",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Audited 30+ compliance actions against regulatory obligations, exposing shared-login risk, and prioritised a Roles and Permissions module over competing scope, replacing every shared login with individual, role-based access. Read the case",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Parsed the AML vendor's specification programmatically, flagged 2 contradictions before build and published a mock service with API contracts, unblocking frontend and QA 3 weeks before sandbox access (~120 hours of rework saved). Read the case",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
