      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Lifted referral-to-signup conversion from 7% to 12% by pinpointing drop-off through funnel and cohort analysis, prioritising an incentive redesign over competing bets and validating it in A/B tests. Read the case",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Owned acquisition-funnel experimentation: landing-page A/B tests prioritised by impact and effort and tracked on self-serve dashboards (DAU/MAU, activation); sign-up conversion nearly doubled, from 10% to 19.1%. Read the case",
      "hidden": false,
