    },
    {
      "t": "Diagnosed bottlenecks in manual payment reconciliation and replaced it with a Razorpay API integration (API specs, QA): payments reconciled in real time with no mismatches, reducing manual reconciliation effort by 99%. Read the case",
      "hidden": false,
