    },
    {
      "t": "Identified enrolment bottlenecks behind stalled waitlists and shipped an automated seat-allocation workflow: 60 of 200 waitlisted learners (30%) converted to enrolments and no seats went unfilled. Read the case",
      "hidden": false,
